<title>BELGIUM: ASTRA satellites reach 67 mln homes - operator.</title>
<headline>ASTRA satellites reach 67 mln homes - operator.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The ASTRA satellite system reaches 67 million homes in Europe, up by 5.6 million or nine percent in 1996, Societe Europeenne des Satellites (SES), the system's private operator said on Friday.</p>
<p>By far the biggest penetration is in Germany, where nearly 28 million households take the system, followed by 6.3 million in the Netherlands, 5.5 million in the United Kingdom, 4.1 million in Belgium and 2.6 million in Switzerland.</p>
<p>SES said that to meet demand it would significantly increase the transmission capacity of the ASTRA system with the launch of four more satellites to add to the six already on orbit.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
